  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……くそ、何が『パワフルスマイルライブ』だ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_j:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（何でも私に聞かず現場で決めろと言ったが、\nそんなことまでやっていいとは言っていないぞ！）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_j:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……そもそも男極リーグは、私の事務所が\n一番だと分からせるために、開いたものだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_j:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ライバル共に、運動会では間違ったルールを渡し……\nその後も、ありとあらゆる妨害を続け……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_j:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "最近はスタッフを無視して現場を混乱させ……！\n今回はステージ中止にまで追い込んだのに……！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_j:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "よく知らない事務所が毎回勝手なことをして、\n話題になる！　私の思惑は外れてばかりだっ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_j:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（フン！　やはりこんな大会はさっさと\n切り捨て、撤収するのが得策だな……）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_j:step-22:text",
        "step_id": 22,
        "step_index": 21,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 21
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そろそろ終盤の男極リーグですが……。\nどなたも優秀で、KINGを決めることが出来ません！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_j:step-29:text",
        "step_id": 29,
        "step_index": 28,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 28
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そこで、どうでしょう？　これまでで特に活躍した\nTOP5の事務所に、優秀賞を差し上げるというのは。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_j:step-30:text",
        "step_id": 30,
        "step_index": 29,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 29
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "予定より多くのアイドル、事務所、\nそしてファンの方々が喜ぶ大団円になりますよ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_j:step-31:text",
        "step_id": 31,
        "step_index": 30,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 33,
          "target_step_index": 30
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（くくく……これなら、\nうち以外の誰かがKINGを獲ることもないしな！）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
